### Read a user by Id
GET http://localhost:3000/user-api/users/12

###create new user
POST http://localhost:3000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id":1,
  "name":"Nani",
  "age":20
}

###update th user
PUT http://localhost:3000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id":1,
  "name":"Lokesh",
  "age":20
}
###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/user-api/users/1




